step	1	5	A workshop for giants
line	<col=000080>I met <col=800000>Kovac</col>, a friendly giant who has found an ancient foundry built for giants. I should meet him inside the <col=800000>Giants' Foundry</col>.</col>
step	2	10	Repairs
line	<str>I met Kovac, a friendly giant who has found an ancient foundry built for giants. I should meet him inside the Giants' Foundry.</str>
line	<col=000080>The foundry's tools are broken. I need to repair the <col=800000>polishing wheel</col>, the <col=800000>grindstone</col> and the <col=800000>trip hammer</col>, then talk to <col=800000>Kovac</col>.</col>
step	3	20	Make-A-Sword
line	<str>I met Kovac, a friendly giant who has found an ancient foundry built for giants. I should meet him inside the Giants' Foundry.</str>
line	<str>The foundry's tools are broken. I need to repair the polishing wheel, the grindstone and the trip hammer, then talk to Kovac.</str>
line	<col=000080>Kovac wants me to make a <col=800000>sword</col>. I should fill the <col=800000>crucible</col> with metal from the crate, set the moulds on the <col=800000>mould jig</col>, pour the metal and cool it, then heat, hammer, grind and polish the preform.</col>
line	<col=000080>When it's done I should hand the sword to <col=800000>Kovac</col>.</col>
done	<str>I helped Kovac repair the tools of the ancient Giants' Foundry and made my first giant sword there.</str>
done	<str>Kovac now lets me take commissions in the foundry.</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
